<title>UK: Generale des Eaux sets $100 mln equity-linked bond.</title>
<headline>Generale des Eaux sets $100 mln equity-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Indosuez.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CIE GENERALE DES EAUX</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    01 APR.03</p>
<p> TYPE   ZERO-COUPON   ISS PRICE  PAR	 REOFFER     PAR</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA1	LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BBB+	DENOMS (K) 10-100</p>
<p> CRS DEFLT  YES	 TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMPTION PRICE IS PAR PLUS GENERALE DES EAUX STOCK</p>
<p>		PERFORMANCE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
